7e;font-size:12px}.history em{padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:700}.history em.approved{color:#28614c;background:#e6f3e9}.history em.rejected{color:#913f38;background:#fbeae7}.muted{display:block;min-height:220px;padding:72px 0;text-align:center}@media(max-width:700px){.panel{padding:20px}.review-toolbar{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.review-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.default-role{width:fit-content}}
